Cell["\<\
The Hamiltonian must be a nonempty square matrix. A rectangular array is \
rejected before the interactive panel is created:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"62d9467c-911b-4be4-a126-f1cf8c052bb3"],

